Outside @PalantirTech today, immigration activists, advocates and lawyers joined me to condemn the dangerous expansion of @DHSgov's mass surveillance system with little oversight and no accountability.

This Palantir-powered digital dragnet is using AI and advanced technology allegedly to surveil and spy on immigrants, but there is nothing stopping them from targeting American citizens too.

@NydiaVelazquez @RonWyden and I wrote a letter to DHS demanding answers, but @SecMullinDHS has not responded. Congress and the American people deserve to know how technology is being used to fuel Trump’s mass deportation agenda.

The call is now coming from inside the house. 

@SpeakerJohnson must immediately schedule a hearing with AI CEO’s so Congress can safeguard the growing AI catastrophe. 

We don’t let banks regulate themselves — this is Congress’s job and Johnson must act immediately.
